  <name>Elopli</name>
  <summary>Control Elgato Key Light devices</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Elopli controls Elgato Key Light and Key Light Air devices over the local network.
      It has no cloud service, account, or telemetry.
    </p>
    <p>
      Power, brightness, warmth, WiFi details, power-on behaviour, pulse and sweep
      animations, and linked lights are available from a tray panel.
    </p>
  </description>
